    "summary": "Small conscript-and-reserve force with a large volunteer Defence League (Kaitseliit), built for total territorial defence alongside the UK-led NATO battlegroup at Tapa. Strong in anti-armour weapons, artillery (K9, CAESAR, HIMARS) and cyber; has served in Iraq, Afghanistan and Mali.",
    "squad_size": 8,
    "fireteam": "8-man squad in two 4-man teams.",
    "tactics": [
      "total defence: reservists and volunteer defence league ambush along forest roads",
      "anti-armour teams with Javelin and Carl Gustaf in depth",
      "dispersal and camouflage against drones",
      "NATO forward-presence battlegroup integration",
      "obstacle belts and pre-planned demolitions as map features",
      "Milrem UGVs for resupply and casevac"
    ],
